%% Figure 4.28 – State Machine Diagram: evidence.review_status (Production evidence) · v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4
%% Same content as CrabShare_State_Machines.drawio, page "evidence.review_status" (generated by gen-state.js, do not edit by hand).
%% «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code (class planned, grey dashed) · (not written by code) = CHECK value never written (class notwritten, orange dashed).
%% Labels are short (trigger [guard] / effect); the full label of each transition is in the %% line under it.
stateDiagram-v2
  state risk <<choice>>
  [*] --> risk : / upload photo (or simulator «planned») · UC45
  %% / created by upload (Operator, live in-app photo): SHA-256 + perceptual hash, crab detection, risk score · UC45 «planned» or submitted by the Device & Camera Simulator through the ingestion API (UC52, source FarmApi)
  risk --> Accepted : [risk < 20]
  risk --> Watch : [20 ≤ risk < 70]
  risk --> Flagged : [risk ≥ 70]
  %% [risk ≥ 70] / linked capture request stays Open
  Watch --> Accepted : verdict Pass [not an investor] · UC47
  %% verdict Pass (Evidence Reviewer) [not an investor of the batch] · UC47
  Watch --> Flagged : verdict NeedMoreEvidence · UC47
  %% verdict NeedMoreEvidence (Reviewer) · UC47
  Watch --> Rejected : verdict Fail · UC47
  %% verdict Fail (Reviewer) · UC47
  Flagged --> Accepted : verdict Pass · UC47
  %% verdict Pass (Reviewer) · UC47
  Flagged --> Rejected : verdict Fail · UC47
  %% verdict Fail (Reviewer) · UC47
  Flagged --> Flagged : explanation / review reopened · UC48
  %% explanation (Operator) / explained_at reopens review for the reviewer who asked · UC48
  Accepted --> [*]
  Rejected --> [*]
  note right of Watch
    «planned» on start → risk - or submitted by the Device and Camera Simulator through the ingestion API (UC52, source FarmApi)
    «planned» investors see box details only for their own rows (UC53).
  end note
  %% Created by upload (Operator, live in-app photo) only if: batch Stocked, InProduction or Harvesting; a box of the batch; GPS and capture time present (UC45).
  %% Risk: exact duplicate 100, similar photo 80, captured more than 24 h before receipt 40, crab detection "no crab" ≤ 15 (weak signal). Detection never rejects evidence alone: a human Evidence Reviewer decides, never on a batch they invested in.
  %% The crab detection module only checks whether a crab is in the box; develop runs a no-op detector (result unknown, adds no risk) until the trained module is integrated.
  %% Accepted evidence feeds the investor timeline and tranche gates; Flagged evidence blocks tranche release. «planned» investors see box details only for their own rows (UC53).
  classDef planned stroke-dasharray:5 5,stroke:#64748b,color:#64748b,fill:#f8fafc
  classDef notwritten stroke-dasharray:5 5,stroke:#9a3412,fill:#f1f5f9
  classDef terminal fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#64748b
  class Accepted, Rejected terminal
